        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Mul-T-Lock G47G1 5/16\" Diameter Shackle Brass Padlock</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe G-series Padlocks from Mul-T-Lock are a medium security solution that offers great value for money. This brass body padlock is anti-corrosive in all weather conditions and its 5/16\" hardened boron alloy shackle make it tamper resistant. This, with the incorporate Mul-T-Lock High Security lock cylinder make it a good choice for general home, industrial and commercial use. \r\n</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/collections/mul-t-lock-padlocks\"><b>MUL-T-LOCK padlocks</b></a> are designed to provide high security door protection with  patented key control. The Key Card owner is the only person allowed to have the keys duplicated.  Remove the worry about anyone making duplicates of your keys. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>Supplied standard with 1 owner key card per key combination and 2 keys per lock cylinder.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-39220-SM.jpg?v=1704354588\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"MUL-T-LOCK G47G1 brass padlock size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/5-16-diameter-protected-shackle-padlock-mul-t-lock-g47p\"><b>5/16\" Diameter Protected Shackle Padlock</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe shackle is locked with a double ball bearing mechanism. 90 degree key rotation unlocks the padlock. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Mul-T-Lock G47G1 Brass Padlock\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5/16\" Diameter Hardened Boron Alloy Shackle</li>\r\n<li>High Corrosion Resistant Brass Padlock Body</li>\r\n<li>Drill and Pick Resistant Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Design</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock 206SP Security Keyway</li>\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Mul-T-Lock G47G1 Brass Padlock\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Shackle Diameter: 5/16\" (8mm)</li>\r\n<li>Padlock Body Height: 2\" (51mm)</li>\r\n<li>Padlock Body  Width: 1-7/8\" (47mm)</li>\r\n<li>Padlock Body  Thickness: 7/8\" (21mm)</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/16\" (26.5mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Nickel Silver</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 Keys per Lock</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/G47G1.pdf?v=1704262191\" target=\"new\"><b>MUL-T-LOCK G47G1 Padlock Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf ordering multiple locks you can have them Key Alike (use the same key) or Keyed Different (different keys for each lock). You can also order <a href=\"/products/cut-keys-for-mul-t-lock-locksets-and-padlocks\">Extra Keys Cut</a> below if more than the standard 2 keys are required.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Medium Duty Brass Padlock With 5/16 Shackle, Mul-T-Lock G47G1",
                "description": "Mul-T-Lock G47G1 Brass Padlock. The G-series Padlocks from Mul-T-Lock are a medium security solution that offers great value for money. This brass body padlock is anti-corrosive in all weather conditions and its 5/16 inch hardened boron alloy shackle make it tamper resistant. This, with the incorporate Mul-T-Lock High Security lock cylinder make it a good choice for general home, industrial and commercial use. ",
                "keywords": "MTL-206SP-G47G1 Medium Duty Brass Padlocks, Mul-T-Lock G47G1 Brass Padlocks, Mul-T-Lock #47 G-Series Padlocks, 5/16 Shackles, mul-t-lock g-series padlocks, Mul-T-Lock high security padlocks, Mul-T-Lock restricted keyway, Mul-T-Lock restricted keys, Mul-T-Lock G47G1 padlocks, Mul-T-Lock 206S-G47G1 padlocks,"
